{"kind": "addon", "id": 29, "name": "SPT Item Creator Wiki", "slug": "spt-item-creator-wiki", "teaser": "The accompanying Wiki systematically organizes data resources and offers complete API references and item creation guides, helping developers and players efficiently utilize the mod and rapidly expand SPT's item database.", "owner_name": "Suntion", "downloads": 465, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T10:00:19.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-01-28T06:31:59.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-01-28T06:31:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": null, "latest_version": "0.1.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">English</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This plugin serves as the centralized release of the Wiki system, documenting the evolution of its structure and content optimization. Key improvements include restructured organization of update logs, corrected descriptions of fields and constants, and expanded examples, usage guides, and item creation tutorials, along with ongoing refinement of documentation formats for IDs and enum values.</p>\n<p>Each version update specifies the minimum required mod version, ensuring synchronization between documentation and mod functionality. The entire documentation framework is built on Python MkDocs, featuring a clear structure and support for bilingual constants, aiming to provide developers with accurate and practical technical references.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">中文</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>此插件是对Wiki系统的集中发布，记录了Wiki文档的结构调整与内容优化历程。重点包括重构更新日志组织方式、修正字段与常量说明、补充示例与使用指引、物品创建教程，并持续完善各类ID和枚举值的文档格式。</p>\n<p>每个版本更新均明确了所需的最低模组版本，确保文档与模组功能同步。整体文档体系基于Python MkDocs构建，结构清晰，支持双语常量，旨在为开发者提供准确、实用的技术参考。</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 911135, "downloads": 167, "published_at": "2026-04-04T14:32:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/download/29/spt-item-creator-wiki/0.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": null, "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 1100067, "downloads": 45, "published_at": "2026-01-28T06:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/download/29/spt-item-creator-wiki/0.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": null, "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.0.5", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 889343, "downloads": 75, "published_at": "2026-02-02T11:25:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/download/29/spt-item-creator-wiki/0.0.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": null, "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 1094522, "downloads": 29, "published_at": "2026-01-23T04:33:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/download/29/spt-item-creator-wiki/0.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": null, "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 1098737, "downloads": 30, "published_at": "2026-01-23T11:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/download/29/spt-item-creator-wiki/0.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": null, "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.0.4", "spt_version_constraint": null, "content_length": 1110850, "downloads": 45, "published_at": "2026-01-30T07:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "h